        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Nine miles of ruts and geese and Bywater mud, and I never let her tip once. The back that bears the barrel has a claim on the bottom of it. My old dad hauled ale all his life and never once paid for a pint -- that's not begging, that's wages."
          }
        }
      }
